- ripser.py and persim (scikit-tda), MIT.
- DREiMac (scikit-tda), Apache-2.0.
- The git submodule external/shape-fitting (BurnyCoder/shape-fitting-in-neural-geometry-in-llm-mechanistic-interpretability), MIT.
